  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Research Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this research was to delve deep into the issue and potential usage of land value capture, with a specific focus on Saameynta activities and the context of Puntland State, one of the three Federal Member States in which Saameynta operates. Since in Puntland State or at the Bosaso Municipal level land governance tools are being tested to capture land value to open up new revenue streams for land administration, but these may not always take into consideration displacement dynamics or support durable solutions</narrative>
  </description>
